---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TerminalPanel from "../components/TerminalPanel.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="OpenEyes | Documentation & CLI"
  description="Complete documentation, installation, and CLI reference for OpenEyes v3.0.1."
  activePage="docs"
>
  <section class="section">
    <h1 class="reveal">Documentation</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc reveal">v3.0.1 Stable</p>

    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <aside class="sidebar reveal">
        <a href="#installation" class="sidebar-link text-mono">01. Installation</a>
        <a href="#quickstart" class="sidebar-link text-mono">02. Quick Start</a>
        <a href="#cli" class="sidebar-link text-mono">03. CLI Reference</a>
        <a href="#ros2" class="sidebar-link text-mono">04. ROS2 Topics</a>
        <a href="#troubleshooting" class="sidebar-link text-mono">05. Troubleshooting</a>
      </aside>

      <article class="doc-content">
        <section id="installation" class="docs-section reveal">
          <h2>01. Installation</h2>
          <p>OpenEyes requires Python 3.10+ and suitable edge hardware for accelerated inference.</p>
          <TerminalPanel title="bash" compact={true}>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-dim"># 1. Clone repository</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">git clone https://github.com/mandarwagh9/openeyes</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">cd openeyes</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"> </div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-dim"># 2. Install dependencies</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">pip install -r requirements.txt</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"> </div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-dim"># 3. Optional Jetson performance mode</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">sudo bash scripts/jetson_perf.sh</span></div>
          </TerminalPanel>
        </section>

        <section id="quickstart" class="docs-section reveal">
          <h2>02. Quick Start</h2>
          <p>Use module execution syntax for local runs:</p>
          <TerminalPanel title="bash" compact={true}>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">python -m src.main --camera 0</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"> </div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">python -m src.main --camera 0 --enable-face --enable-gesture --enable-pose</span></div>
            <div class="term-line"> </div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">python -m src.main --deepstream --camera 0</span></div>
          </TerminalPanel>
        </section>

        <section id="cli" class="docs-section reveal">
          <h2>03. CLI Reference</h2>
          <table class="spec-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Flag</th>
                <th>Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--camera [ID]</span></td>
                <td>Camera device index.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--video [FILE]</span></td>
                <td>Process video file instead of camera stream.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--enable-face</span></td>
                <td>Enable face detection pipeline.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--enable-gesture</span></td>
                <td>Enable gesture recognition pipeline.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--enable-pose</span></td>
                <td>Enable body pose estimation.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--deepstream</span></td>
                <td>Enable DeepStream inference pipeline.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--api</span></td>
                <td>Start REST API server.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">--world-model</span></td>
                <td>Enable predictive world model mode.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section id="ros2" class="docs-section reveal">
          <h2>04. ROS2 Telemetry</h2>
          <p>OpenEyes can publish detection and state outputs to ROS2 topics.</p>
          <TerminalPanel title="bash" compact={true}>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-cmd">ros2 launch openeyes openeyes.launch.py device:=cuda ros2:=true</span></div>
          </TerminalPanel>

          <table class="spec-table" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Topic</th>
                <th>Payload</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/detections</span></td>
                <td>Object detections</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/depth</span></td>
                <td>Depth image or map output</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/faces</span></td>
                <td>Face detections</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/gestures</span></td>
                <td>Gesture status</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/poses</span></td>
                <td>Pose detections</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="text-mono">/vision/status</span></td>
                <td>System state</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section id="troubleshooting" class="docs-section reveal">
          <h2>05. Troubleshooting</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Camera not found:</strong> verify camera permissions and selected index.</li>
            <li><strong>Slow startup:</strong> first-run model initialization can take additional time.</li>
            <li><strong>No ROS2 data:</strong> ensure ROS2 dependencies are installed and sourced, then allow startup to finish.</li>
            <li><strong>DeepStream issues:</strong> verify NVIDIA stack and matching runtime libraries.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
